# Records a right turn in slow motion (1/8 speed) with each turn camera, for turn_gif.ps1.
# Z: EASE -> EASE SLOW -> LINEAR SLOW. Shots are taken back to back (~10 a second).
wait 17
# The game starts in 1st person; these steps were written from iso, so switch to it first
press down
wait 0.3
press down
press z
wait 1.5
shot gif_ease_pre
press right
shot gif_ease_00
shot gif_ease_01
shot gif_ease_02
shot gif_ease_03
shot gif_ease_04
shot gif_ease_05
shot gif_ease_06
